@chapter Pascal Frontend

@cindex Pascal frontend
@cindex Pascal syntax
@cindex Pascal keywords
@cindex Pascal operators

This chapter describes the Pascal frontend of the EightBol compiler. The
frontend translates Pascal source code into an abstract syntax tree (AST)
that is subsequently processed by the code generation backends. The
frontend supports a simplified Pascal dialect designed for game development
and embedded systems programming.

